# Chunking · documents (feature 023): what is in the graph, read by chunking through data over HTTP.
# Se ejecutan con la extensión REST Client de VS Code ("Send Request" sobre cada una) o con httpyac.
# Requiere Neo4j y al menos una corrida (runs.http). Usa respuestas anteriores (# @name, sintaxis de REST Client).

@chunking = http://127.0.0.1:8000/chunking

### documents · the documents in the graph (chunked or in error), ordered by sha256
# @name documents
GET {{chunking}}/documents?page=1&per_page=10

### documents · one of them: origin in base/, status, fingerprint, chunks, max_tokens, tokenizer
GET {{chunking}}/documents/{{documents.response.body.$.documents[0].sha256}}

### documents · its sections and chunks, in order (headings, pages, tokens <= max_tokens)
GET {{chunking}}/documents/{{documents.response.body.$.documents[0].sha256}}/chunks

### documents · unknown sha256 (404)
GET {{chunking}}/documents/nope/chunks
